ull, \"evidence\": \"Entry form displays type-appropriate controls: Task Name field uses textbox, Priority uses spinbutton (numeric only), Due Date uses date input (with calendar), Completed uses checkbox. All field types are clearly labeled with their names above the controls. Field configuration dialog also shows clear type labels (Text, Number, Date, Checkbox).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checkbox states are clearly distinguishable: Checked state shows \\\"Yes\\\" in cards and check icon in table (with text-success class). Unchecked state shows \\\"No\\\" in cards and X icon in table (with text-muted-foreground class). Different visual indicators (icons and text) make states immediately clear.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Quick search for \\\"API\\\" matched the displayed text value \\\"Update API documentation\\\" in Task Name field. Search works on formatted/displayed values shown to users in the table view, not on raw internal values.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searched for \\\"API\\\" in search box - only \\\"Update API documentation\\\" entry displayed (1 entry matching \\\"API\\\"). Search matched text field value case-insensitively. Status updated to show \\\"1 entry matching 'API'\\\". Clicked clear button - all 6 entries restored, status shows \\\"6 entries\\\", search box empty.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selected sort field \\\"Priority\\\" from menu - entries immediately reordered from original order to Priority 1,1,2,2,3,3 ascending. Active field identified by \\\"Priority\\\" button label in sort area and column header indicator. Direction shown in status \\\"Sorted by Priority (ascending)\\\". App remained fully usable during and after sort.\"}]}"
